# Preserve the source SDE and generated atlas data in version control.

# Desktop shell build output
/dist/
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/

# CCP's Static Data Export.
#
# An input rather than a product, so it is fetched rather than committed - 95 MB that
# every clone would otherwise pay for, for ever, once per version. `README.md` says where
# to get it and where to put it, and `scripts/verify_offline_map.py` says what cannot be
# checked without it. Ignored rather than merely absent, so a fetched copy cannot become
# tracked by a `git add -A`.
source/

# Working-tree backups
atlas-backup-*.zip
